816	/// VR-24 (h), VR-26): `follow` `center` (the window at fill × `zoom` on the
817	/// cropped centre) and `fit` (the cropped picture fitted; `zoom` unread).
818	/// `None` for no such clip, no size, a base rotation other than 0, a zoom
819	/// outside 1…4, or a crop or scale that leaves no picture. Offsets are
